WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:07.400
At some point summer vacation ended, and the new semester started!

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.360
I didn't even have time to write my picture diary.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.780
Morning, Sonya-chan!

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.370
I told you not to approach me from behind.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.290
I forgot over the course of summer...

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.670
But it's all better now!

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.330
You heal pretty fast.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.840
Or maybe you got weaker?

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.880
Is the summer heat getting to a pro like you?

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.220
How about we find out then?

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:42.140
S-Sorry! I was wrong!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.920
Lunch break.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.510
Sonya-chan...

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:37.630
What?

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.760
I realized something troubling.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.640
Troubling?

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.430
I haven't eaten shaved ice at all this summer!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:52.730
It'd be such a waste to go a year without eating shaved ice!

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.440
Does it really matter?

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.650
Well aren't you high and mighty!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:00.150
Fine, then you don't get to eat shaved ice in summer for the rest of your life!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.530
What the heck?

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:11.540
On that note, I bought a cheap out-of-season and weirdly shaped shaved ice machine!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.460
Wasting money on that crap again...

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.510
Today's dessert is shaved ice buffet!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.920
So, where's the ice?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:20.840
Eh?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.470
You didn't bring any?

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.600
Why did you assume I would?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.270
It's over...

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.480
My summer...

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.650
It's been over for a while already.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:38.230
I even brought the flavorings...

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.740
What the heck is this green thing?

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:42.570
Vegetable juice?!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:46.660
That's the one I was going to trick you into using...

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.790
It's too bad you didn't get the chance!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:55.210
Wait! I was just looking out for your health!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.670
It's smooth and easy to drink!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:07.600
Maybe Agiri-san has something up her sleeve!

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.560
Like, poof! Here you go!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.480
So please call her.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.860
Such a hassle.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.070
She's not picking up.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.120
What's that sound?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.370
Since when...

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.500
I don't know...

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.090
You called?

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:50.470
A ninja technique for freezing water?

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.850
Yes!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:55.230
That's pretty difficult.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:05:00.730
Or a magic trick where you pull it out of someplace like you always do!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.490
Let's see...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.830
I can do dry ice.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.330
Whoops!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.710
I was holding that with my bare hands.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.720
What do we do with this?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.390
You're asking me...

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.510
Let's try it out so it doesn't go to waste then.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:41.270
It looks quite daunting.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:44.190
I don't really want to try eating it though.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.110
You guys have too much time on your hands.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.620
It's all done! Here!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.620
Down it all in one bite!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.540
Don't let us down!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.710
The carbon dioxide!

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:08.180
C-Carbon... carbon dioxide...

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:13.390
It's not ice, but I have a technique for making it snow.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.520
Wow!

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.730
We'll launch this into the sky to make snow fall.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.190
I want to see!

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:24.650
Sure.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.400
Let's go to the roof then.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.530
Yay!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.620
Try to catch me!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.160
She's totally forgotten her original goal.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.050
Here we go.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:55.010
Is it coming? Is it coming?

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.180
Here it comes.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:02.980
Yay! Snow!

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.770
It's snowing!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.740
It landed kind of...

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.780
No, this is really awesome!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.160
I caught one!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:20.160
I can't tell if you're serious or just really confused.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:25.590
But how did you make this snowball?

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.340
Oh, that's simple.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:35.810
It's not a ninja technique, but I do have ice on me.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:37.770
Say so next time!

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.780
Finally, the real thing!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:48.650
That's huge!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.570
So good!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.780
Yummy!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.460
So good!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.590
Delicious!

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:11.420
Cold!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.880
You ate too much.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.800
I'm frozen to my bones...

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.310
They say eatings spicy things makes you feel warmer.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.600
I've heard that too!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.560
Let's do it!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.770
It's just spicy!!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:27.980
What an idiot.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.990
This is a preying mantis.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.910
I'm glad I achieved my goal.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.920
Now I've got nothing left to do this summer.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:54.510
The pool! I haven't gone swimming this summer!

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.340
It was closed for repairs!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.020
Sorry, forget it.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.480
We can go next yea—

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.480
Off you go.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.240
After school.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.420
Alright! Time to go home!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.240
Let's drop by your place on the way back!

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:00.410
No.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.580
So straight!

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.660
Why not?

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.870
Because.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:07.160
It's fine! I don't care about messy rooms!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.330
Everyone gets lazy once in a while!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.000
Don't mind!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.630
Don't just go assuming things.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.420
That's not it.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.260
I can't let people know where I live because of my work.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.930
Come on, I won't tell anyone!

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.520
It's fine!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.430
I'm good at keeping secrets!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.690
I can't trust you at all.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:32.820
I want to go!

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:34.650
Stop being such a baby.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.740
I'll follow you!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.320
I can easily lose you.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.740
And why do you want to come so badly, anyway?

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.780
I just want to!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.830
I want to look around your room and stuff!

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.580
Forget about my work, I just don't want you to come.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.540
I want to go! I want to go!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:56.170
Fine. I'll think about it if you do exactly what I say.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.260
Really?!

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.800
Put this on.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:02.140
An eye mask?

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:08.520
I get it! You can carry me while I'm sleeping so I won't remember the route!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.390
Then I'll leave it to you—

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.190
What are you doing...

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.940
That's far too much trouble.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:19.070
I'm just going to make you cover your eyes and plug your ears.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.650
Earplugs too?

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.830
Wow, I can't hear anything.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.160
You really can't?

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:28.910
Yep!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.580
You little...

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:35.840
Wow, it's pitch black and I can't hear anything...

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.300
Wh-What?

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.760
I can't get it off!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.890
This was a trap after all!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.100
What the heck are you doing?

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:52.100
The autumn of reading. The autumn of eating.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.350
This is a dragonfly.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.530
It's scary not being able to hear or see anything...

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.200
I can only follow her without complaining.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.750
I said, there's a sign board there.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.920
Oh, right. You can't hear.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.050
You awake now?

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:25.800
Where am I?

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.260
Your house?

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:32.100
This is... unexpectedly Japanese style.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.100
Well, because it's my house.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.560
That voice!

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:43.110
That ceiling tile's just out of place.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.070
Eh? This is your house, Agiri-san?

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.620
Where's Sonya-chan's house?!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:51.410
You fainted halfway, so I just brought you to the closest place.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.160
Maybe I should have just left you there.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:59.590
So does that mean this is a ninja house?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:03.340
There are a number of hidden mechanisms all over.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.260
For example...

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.720
This storage compartment in the floor.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:10.720
Wow!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.730
Isn't that pretty normal?

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.640
A hanging scroll!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.730
And behind it is...

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.730
A secret tunnel, of course.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.690
I knew it!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:24.150
I want to see!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.120
Oh, she came back.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.330
Why does it go to the toilet?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.380
It's convenient, no?

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.000
Don't you have any tricksy gadgets?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.760
Of course.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.680
When you move this ornament...

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:47.720
Oh crap!

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.430
The air conditioner turns on.

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:58.900
Unexpected, right?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.440
A disappointing unexpectedness.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.280
You have a TV!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.070
It looks pretty normal.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.870
You little...

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.250
It wasn't on purpose!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:15.910
You little...

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.710
Ouch!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.630
I've got a bad feeling about...

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.760
Huh? Nothing happened...

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:31.760
Or so I thought, but this gas doesn't look good!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.100
This looks bad, so I'm out of here.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.520
Wait! Agiri-san!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:44.900
It's fine, the gas is totally harmless.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.740
Your face isn't convincing at all!

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:51.160
It's just sleeping gas.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.590
I've got to carry her while she sleeps again?

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.890
Come to think of it, I don't know where she lives.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.890
What should I do?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.610
Huh?

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.410
Where am I?

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.460
Gale winds are expected due to the typhoon tomorrow.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.760
Public transportation schedules are expected to be disrupted, so please take note.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.730
I'm gonna get blown away!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.940
Help me!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.270
Stop right there.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.900
Just get blown away already.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:11.650
Typhoons are exciting!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.570
Idiots sure love typhoons, huh?

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:17.530
I thought of an awesome move I can use with this wind!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.540
Let's see you handle it!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:22.290
Take this! Windward Punch!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:22.960
Wind.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.920
That's stupid.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.970
I can't rely on the forces of nature...

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.550
Then we'll go with a battle of wits!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.890
Wits?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.430
<i>Toss the bag.</i>

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:44.730
<i>Your opponent unintentionally catches it with both hands, then you strike while their hands are occupied.</i>

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:45.850
It's perfect!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:52.280
Damn you!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.740
Windward Punch!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.620
What's wrong?

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.450
Are you half-asleep this early?

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.870
I wonder who's half-asleep!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.750
You mixed up your knife and your toothbrush.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.580
What?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.920
You tricked me!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:11.960
Damn it...

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.050
I got something in my eye.

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:18.220
A-Are you okay?

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.680
Sh-Shut up!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.600
Where are you?

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:22.060
Are you over here?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.100
Ah, that's...

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.140
Ow...

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.530
Lunch break.

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.960
Wow. It looks like it's gonna rain.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.460
Another Teru Teru Bouzu?

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.670
This time I made a long one.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:52.800
I'm boosting its power by making it like a string of paper cranes.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:56.220
It doesn't look like a Teru Teru Bouzu anymore.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:04.350
Now it's sure to clear up.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.230
The other day I had some rice crackers.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:14.150
Dear! It's the dragon god!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.150
They were great.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.990
You should buy some more.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.900
It flew off.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.910
Do something about it.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:24.330
By the way, why do you think Raijin takes away your belly button?

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.660
Where did that come from?

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.000
Do you think he has a belly button fetish?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.040
Stop it!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.340
Pretty sure that's not it.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:35.300
Since he's a god and all, he should take something more valuable than that.

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:36.590
Like what?

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.140
Cash?

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.760
You think gods are like bandits?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.600
During class.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:55.980
From 2500 BC to 1800 BC, people referred to it as the "Hill of Death."

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.070
A blackout!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.280
What the heck?!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.740
No one can see right now!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:11.670
This is the perfect opportunity to do something I normally wouldn't do in the classroom!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.260
Oribe-kun.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.760
The same thing happened in an elevator a while back.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.400
Another blackout?

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.610
I was just going to the bathroom...

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.570
Why?

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.410
No, it's just...

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.040
And here's the rain.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.350
It's gone!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.730
You used it all during lunch.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.190
Sonya-chan!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.190
I forgot my umbrella, so can I share with you?

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.650
I'll hold it.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.070
Fine.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.490
Oh, it's got a switch!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.210
Let's go already.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.010
Huh?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.550
What's wrong?

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.930
I thought I saw something move...

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:58.360
G-G-G-Get it off!

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.360
Ribbit, ribbit!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.070
Get away!

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.280
W-Wait! You'll get wet!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:06.450
You'll get wet... Get it off!!

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.830
That scared me.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:11.450
That got me a bit wet.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:16.330
N-No! That wasn't me!

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.130
I didn't do it on purpose!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:19.710
I know that.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.880
Ah, it looks like a satellite dish!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.920
So cool!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.970
Just fix it already!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:28.050
You idiot! It's gonna break!

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.520
This is useless now.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:38.690
Ow.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.450
Lucky us!

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.860
Someone dropped their umbrella!

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:49.950
I'm takin' it!

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.380
The next day.

